    "value": "<p>Artists for Kids is grateful for the generosity and commitment of the Canadian artists who have worked directly with children and youth through the many Artist for Kids' educational programs and who have gifted work to the Artists for Kids Limited Edition Portfolio for over 37 years.</p>\n<p>The Artists for Kids Limited Edition program releases Seasonal Portfolios of artworks for acquisition. The releases feature limited editions of both new and existing artist collaborators.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.inuitartfoundation.org/profiles/artist/kenojuak-ashevak\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Kenojuak Ashevak</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.gibsongallery.com/artists/anne-meredith-barry/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Anne Meredith Barry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://robertbateman.ca/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Bateman</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.gallery.ca/sites/default/files/upload/library/bc_binning_bio_e.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">B.C. Binning</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.davidblackwood.com/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">David Blackwood</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.aci-iac.ca/art-books/molly-lamb-bobak/biography/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Molly Lamb Bobak</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.studiolaurenjames.com/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Lauren Brevner</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.karinbubas.ca/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Karin Bubaš</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.edwardburtynsky.com/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Edward Burtynsky</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.ameliabutcher.ca/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Amelia Butcher</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.cicansky.ca/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Victor Cicansky</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://coupland.com/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Douglas Coupland</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.robertdavidson.ca/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\